cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this work, cite it as below and state that it is a model-only design study with no hardware validation."
title: "BOLLEY: A Cooperative-Interface CubeSat Deployment Study"
abstract: "BOLLEY examines whether a CubeSat carrying passive reaction hardware can remove the moving launcher sled, brake and return stroke from a programmable deployment system. The repository preserves rejected architectures, controlled calculations, nonlinear field models, parametric CAD and an explicit computational-closure queue. Nothing has been built, fired, measured, qualified or flown."
type: software
